Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:09.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is another very, very special day{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是无比特别的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:13.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Valentin Vacherot. He’s the Basel champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗 他是巴塞尔冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.77,TL,,0,0,0,,去年上海 世界第{\fs78}204{\fs68}的瓦舍罗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:20.03,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛一路赢到大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:32.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match, Vacherot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 瓦舍罗获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:32.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大比分二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:41.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot puts the icing on the cake to a fairy tale week in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗为上海童话画下圆满句号
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.97,TL,,0,0,0,,此后在巴黎打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:49.23,TL,,0,0,0,,今年在蒙卡打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.72,TL,,0,0,0,,随后左脚受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:54.17,TL,,0,0,0,,法网第二轮赛前退赛 也错过温网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:57.58,TL,,0,0,0,,复出以后 他又在东京打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:03.00,TL,,0,0,0,,到了巴塞尔 先过纳沃内
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.19,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 拿下首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That’s a good win in straights, to say the least.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场两盘拿下的胜利 确实相当不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.96,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮 两次抢七都拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:20.01,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦舍罗 {\fs78}3{\fs68}盘闯过霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:28.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is victory for Vacherot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗赢下了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:32.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big win for the Monegasque.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N摩纳哥人的一场重要胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.45,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Top 20 victory.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败了世界前二十的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.69,TL,,0,0,0,,对鲁内 首盘拿下 又被追平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}个破发点 他化解了{\fs78}9{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:59.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Vacherot books his spot in the final four in Basel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗跻身巴塞尔半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:03.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fourth time he has achieved that at tour level in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他第四次打进巡回赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:04.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A semi-final place.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿到了半决赛席位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.77,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 再过弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:08.76,TL,,0,0,0,,上海之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.79,TL,,0,0,0,,瓦舍罗又打进了巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:23.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Valentin Vacherot blasts his way into the final in Basel.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗强势挺进巴塞尔决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.55,0:02:25.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a finish!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么漂亮的收尾！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:30.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It’s been a special shot this week, that backhand.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 他的反手表现非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:32.62,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 对面是莱赫奇卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:33.89,TL,,0,0,0,,不到一个月前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:36.59,TL,,0,0,0,,他在东京刚输给过这个对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:44.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a break for Lehecka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱赫奇卡完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:48.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Perfect start for the Czech, looking very calm and composed.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N捷克人的开局完美 沉着冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:51.12,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.12,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 他先稳住发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.12,0:02:55.14,TL,,0,0,0,,再去争取机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time he converts.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 他把握住了破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.28,TL,,0,0,0,,这次破发让他拉开差距
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:18.04,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 瓦舍罗把比赛带进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:19.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Set point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:26.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, he took the scenic route serving it out, but he got there in the end.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N发球胜盘有些曲折 他最终拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:43.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow, no. Another shocker. So far in the third.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇 不妙 决胜盘又是糟糕表现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:46.65,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘开局破发后 他守住了领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:49.74,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一步 还要赢下冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:15.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is another very, very special day{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是无比特别的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:20.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Valentin Vacherot. He’s the Basel champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦舍罗 他是巴塞尔冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:23.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an achievement!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么了不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:28.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second ATP title after Shanghai last year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上海之后 第二座巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:36.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}His first at ATP 500 level, and makes a bit of history.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首座{\fs78}ATP500{\fs68}冠军 写下历史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.24,TL,,0,0,0,,上海之后 再捧冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.89,TL,,0,0,0,,你是从上海 还是巴塞尔记住他的？
